=== Install Widget Manager (level 1) https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Install.htm#Install
--- Install Widget Manager
# Install Widget Manager

**Required User Role:** Operator, Auditor, or Administrator

**Required [user role](https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Roles.htm) when using** Widget Hub**:** Hub Administrator

You can install Widget Manager on a host that meets the [system requirements](https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Requirements.htm). Values like *PAIRING_KEY* and \*stars\* stay readable, and \<placeholders> are escaped.

> **Note:** Widget Manager does not support symbolic links for `/opt/widget/`.

> **Tip:** Install during a maintenance window.
>
> The installer restarts the `widgetd` service.

=== Before you begin (level 2) https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Install.htm#BeforeYouBegin
--- Install Widget Manager › Before you begin
## Before you begin

**Before you begin:**

- Open port 8443 to the host.

- Install the dependency:

  ```
  dnf install -y widget-deps
  systemctl enable widget-deps
  ```

=== Install on Linux (level 2) https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Install.htm#Steps
--- Install Widget Manager › Install on Linux
## Install on Linux

1. [Download](https://downloads.example/widget) the package. Select the [more vertical] button, then [Export].

2. Run the installer for your distribution:

   **Debian**

   `# dpkg -i Widget-<version>.deb`

   ```
   widget-setup --key "<KEY>" \
     --port 8443
   ```

4. **Restart the service.**
   - On a remote host, go to https://\<host>:8443.
   - On the local host, go to https://localhost:8443.

=== Troubleshooting (level 2) https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Install.htm
--- Install Widget Manager › Troubleshooting
## Troubleshooting

Why does the installer pause?

It waits for the hub license check.

**Advanced options**

**Not a section**

Headings inside drop-downs stay in their section.

=== Ports (level 2) https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Install.htm#Ports
--- Install Widget Manager › Ports
## Ports

| Port | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| 8443 | Web interface \| API |
| 9000 | Agent traffic.<br>Required for [pairing](https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Install.htm#BeforeYouBegin). |

=== Sizing (level 2) https://docs.tenable.com/widget/Content/Install.htm#Sizing
--- Install Widget Manager › Sizing
## Sizing

**Small sites**

- **Hosts:** Up to 500
  - **CPU Cores1 (Physical cores.):** 2
  - **Memory:** 8 GB
- **Hosts:** Up to 500
  - **CPU Cores1 (Physical cores.):** 4
  - **Memory:** 16 GB

- **Environment:** Virtual / Hypervisor A
  - **File:** `.ova`
- **Environment:** Hardware
  - **File:** `.iso`

